{"c":[{"name":"20261005T173413Z-41b9cc8b0f0c0c83","text":"G2: drafts.ts restates() (skip Jev for a restated sentence) is a closed-frame clause-suffix rule; two reviews found 5 bypasses in looser versions (token sets, 'Avoid saying', 'NOT saying', 'provided'); never widen it by adding words.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T180513Z-82a90a8786c261a8","text":"G2: live Jev (Ask's yes/no value question, 0.75 floor) confirmed Order number but not a reply's sender in To or a derived calendar event for 'add this meeting to my calendar and draft a reply to Priya', so D2-06 scene 2 ends partial live; see evidence/screen/g2 jev-*-probe.txt.","type":"note"}]}
